  logw[:, j, :] += L[:, j][:, None] * lr_j + np.where(other[:, None] > 0, other[:, None] * lr_o, 0.0)
SECTION 8: k=2 siblings, 1000 packets/epoch total, horizon 8e5 packets, alpha=0.05, 1000 runs
